how to used variable and function

JavaScript Notes with Small Examples:

var (global scope):
var a = 10; console.log(a);

let (block/function scope):
let b = 5; console.log(b);

const (cannot change value):
const pi = 3.14;

if–else condition:
if (a > 5) { console.log("True"); } else { console.log("False"); }

Function:
function fruit(item){ console.log(item); } fruit("Apple");

for loop:
for(let i=0; i<3; i++){ console.log(i); }

while loop:
let i=0; while(i<3){ console.log(i); i++; }

Array:
let users = ["Amit","Neha"]; console.log(users[0])

Object:
let book = { name:"JS", price:200 };

Node.js require():
const data = require("./data.js"); console.log(data);